00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:36.580
- Somewhat, because I really
do have a place to go.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:37.510
I choose not to,

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:40.470
because I have a choice of drug,

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:42.903
and I have to get what I need,

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:44.840
how I need to get it.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:45.770
- [Interviewer] So by staying down here,

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.110
you're close to your supply?

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:49.740
- Yeah, of course.
- And what's your drug?

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:51.790
- Crack cocaine, you know?

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:56.790
And I know if my kids are
watching this, I apologize,

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:01.330
but it is what it is, you know?

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:02.163
It's reality.

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:06.200
I do intend to stop,

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.160
