us or be our support.

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:02.723
You know what I'm saying?

00:08:02.723 --> 00:08:05.090
To help us get off slowly,

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:08.230
or however we have to get off, you know?

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:10.510
'Cause it ain't easy for me. I tried it.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.140
