if you're a sex worker,

00:11:54.146 --> 00:11:55.690
but on the street.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.140
- I'm gonna tell you, it
is scary in the street.

00:11:58.140 --> 00:11:59.660
You know what I'm saying?

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:04.660
When a person either sticks a
knife to your head or a gun,

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:09.144
you know, and they're raping you,

00:12:09.144 --> 00:12:10.770
you know, you don't even
know if it's the last moment

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.891
you're gonna live, you know?

00:12:12.891 --> 00:12:13.910
And it is scary.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:15.760
It's something powerful

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:17.810
that you just don't understand, you know?

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:23.553
And it's something that's kind of,

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:27.360
you know, you have to
just either take the risk

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:29.423
or go and high, you know?

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:31.123
And numb yourself,

00:12:31.123 --> 00:12:33.720
so you know that you're
safe and you're okay.

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:36.820
So, you know,

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:39.120
that's the type of things
that people don't understand,

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:40.850
what's the hurt in the things that we do

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:41.950
in the streets, you know?

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:43.773
Straight up, they don't.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.330
But even though that has happened to me,

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.080
it's made me a stronger woman

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:50.550
and understand that taking responsibility

00:12:50.550 --> 00:12:52.400
is something that's okay.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:53.410
It's okay to surrender

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:56.400
and know that it's, you know, nothing bad.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.280
Who cares if the next
person talks about you?

00:12:58.280 --> 00:13:00.120
They really not doing nothing

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.960
for you or your habit, you know?

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:05.638
- [Interviewer] Has living
this lifestyle changed you,

00:13:05.638 --> 00:13:06.660
made you stronger?

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.210
- It has.

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:09.770
But it has made me think too,

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:11.253
like, I do wanna stop.

00:13:12.125 --> 00:13:13.770
I don't know when is the time.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.430
But some people tell me
when I try to get advice

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:17.977
from other people, they tell me,

00:13:17.977 --> 00:13:19.413
"You don't know.

00:13:19.413 --> 00:13:22.703
You don't know the moment
because you'll leave.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:27.260
Then the moment you leave,
you'll know you're done."

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:29.200
So I guess then I will know.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.283
But right now I'm still not ready.

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:34.460
You know, straight up. I'm not.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:35.740
- [Interviewer] Do you have family members

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:38.310
