00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:40.593
Now they know,

00:13:40.593 --> 00:13:43.540
so they don't try to pressure
me or get me to go home,

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:46.360
because they know that
if they do that, I run,

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.380
and they don't wanna do that.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.500
They just want me to come by myself.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:50.650
So they say, "When you're ready,

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:52.983
you know, your house is here.

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:54.860
Come whenever you want."

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:57.070
- [Interviewer] One of the
best things I've heard,

00:13:57.070 --> 00:13:59.070
somebody who works at a rehab said that,

00:14:00.647 --> 00:14:03.693
"When an addict's ready to
quit, no one can stop them.

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.280
But when an attic isn't ready to quit,

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.710
no one can make them."

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:10.050
- I know, and they can't,

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:11.663
because even my mom,

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:15.460
I have her phone,

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:17.690
'cause a couple of days back

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:20.463
I got drugged and raped,

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:25.943
and they stole my other
phone my mom bought me,

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:29.133
just to keep in contact with me.

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:32.570
I don't know why the people did it.

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:33.623
I didn't know them.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:37.698
And you know, I thought
I was safe with them.

00:14:37.698 --> 00:14:38.531
Little do you know,

00:14:38.531 --> 00:14:40.833
your own race can do
so much damage to you.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:45.080
And people are talking about criticism

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:50.080
of other races, like Blacks
and Whites and Asians,

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:51.840
or whatever,

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:55.190
but your own kind can
get you too, you know?

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:57.540
And it was a heroin addict
that did that to me,

00:14:58.700 --> 00:14:59.950
and a female at that.

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:03.033
She set me up with her own
friends so I can get raped.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:06.487
It's kind of scary thing, you know?

00:15:06.487 --> 00:15:09.470
You think that you have
somebody you can trust,

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.690
and that person betrays you.

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:15.620
She gave me the date rape
drug in a liquid form,

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:17.120
in a cigarette,

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:18.053
and I didn't know.

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:21.880
And when I woke up,

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.134
I knew it was something weird,

00:15:24.134 --> 00:15:26.084
'cause I didn't wake up with any shoes,

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:29.070
my bag, my phones,

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.130
everything was gone.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:34.763
But I had bad aches on my body.

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:37.513
They raped me,

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:40.920
they even had the nerve
to put my pants back

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:42.960
exactly the way they were,

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.090
but I didn't have shoes on.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:46.440
But probably my body was hurting

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:48.620
because I was fighting
back without knowing,

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.780
you know, consciously.

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.680
But I was gone.

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.860
My mind didn't allow me to see or feel.

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:57.600
You know, and the weirdest
thing that I know,

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.370
like God exists, should I say,

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:02.120
'cause I woke up at a church,

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.053
like the back steps of a church,

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:08.260
and I didn't know, you know?

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:10.040
And I always say that God has,

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:14.250
no matter what, he's kept me alive.

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:18.760
So I know that I'm not meant to die yet,

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:22.640
but I still don't wanna
live all my life, until,

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:23.473
like, you know,

00:16:23.473 --> 00:16:26.160
the day that I die is the
last day I'm gonna get high.

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:28.560
I do wanna have a better life.

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:31.173
I do wanna get out of downtown.

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:35.630
I do wanna get my children back, you know?

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:40.630
And I want my life back.
