00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.430
- No, it was just something that...

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.850
Someone was beating me,

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:27.770
and he would only beat me on this drug,

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:31.100
but I didn't know he was
