00:17:33.643 --> 00:17:36.313
and then I said, "Well, wow.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.060
That's the reason?

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:40.570
I'm gonna try it."

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:43.273
So I found a way to get
it, which wasn't hard.

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:46.287
I did it.

00:17:46.287 --> 00:17:48.690
And it was over, you know?

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:50.930
