00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:16.730
Whenever I'm ready.

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:18.730
Hopefully I'm not like 70

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:22.870
when I'm long and ready
to change, you know?

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.850
I hope it's sooner than that.

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:28.110
You know, just for those
